ded skies."],"widgets_values_named":{"text_0":"A woman in a red coat waiting at a tram stop. Rendered as a cyanotype print: deep Prussian blue ground with white highlighted areas where light was blocked, contact-printed from botanical specimens or negatives, the soft tonal range rendered entirely in shades of blue. Lit by golden-hour sunlight falling low from the side - long crisp shadows, rim-lit edges glowing amber-orange against softened warm highlights, the whole scene wrapped in the last deep light of the afternoon. By Ansel Adams, crisp large-format black-and-white landscapes, full tonal range from deep black to pure white, every texture sharp from foreground to distant peak under dramatic clouded skies."},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":19,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-140],"size":[300,110],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"📐 Image Size","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 📐 Image Size\n\n👇 Set the image size (width / height / batch) here."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### 📐 Image Size\n\n👇 Set the image size (width / height / batch) here."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":20,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[340,-140],"size":[300,110],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"🧠 Models","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🧠 Models\n\n👇 Swap models here to change the whole look."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### 🧠 Models\n\n👇 Swap models here to change the whole look."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":21,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[680,-250],"size":[450,180],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"✍️ Prompts and Style Selection","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### ✍️ Prompts\n\n✍️ Enter prompt text in the Stylebook Style node, and it will be automatically enhanced.\n\nModels with CFG1 (like Krea) will not actually use negatives, but the connection is shown here for illustrative purposes.\n\nYou can manually pick any style/artist/modifier (or randomize, or mix and match as you please!). Check out the galleries/references!"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### ✍️ Prompts\n\n✍️ Enter prompt text in the Stylebook Style node, and it will be automatically enhanced.\n\nModels with CFG1 (like Krea) will not actually use negatives, but the connection is shown here for illustrative purposes.\n\nYou can manually pick any style/artist/modifier (or randomize, or mix and match as you please!). Check out the galleries/references!"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2210,-230],"size":[380,190],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"🎛️ Sampling","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### Sampling\n\nKrea2 Turbo uses CFG 1.0, steps 8-12, and can handle a few samplers/schedulers. I've had good results with er_sde/beta or euler/simple."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### Sampling\n\nKrea2 Turbo uses CFG 1.0, steps 8-12, and can handle a few samplers/schedulers. I've had good results with er_sde/beta or euler/simple."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":23,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2840,-140],"size":[340,110],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"💾 Output","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 💾 Output\n\n💾 Finished images land here (check the filename prefix)."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### 💾 Output\n\n💾 Finished images land here (check the filename prefix)."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":24,"type":"ResolutionSelector","pos":[0,10],"size":[270,150],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"aspect_ratio","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"megapixels","name":"megapixels","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"megapixels"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"multiple","name":"multiple","type":"INT","widget":{"